@pearl_leasing_HostAddress = http://localhost:7261
# Pwede mo rin gamitin ang HTTPS port mo (e.g., https://localhost:7162) kung ayaw ng HTTP.

### 1. CREATE ADMIN USER
POST {{pearl_leasing_HostAddress}}/api/users/create-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_pearl",
  "email": "admin@pearlleasing.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "firstName": "Keneth",
  "lastName": "Liwanag"
}

###

### 2. LOGIN USER (Para makuha ang JWT Token)
POST {{pearl_leasing_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_pearl",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}